sequenceDiagram
    %% MA-CONTRACT-1.0 | Local old/new chat MVP; implementation verification pending
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Host as LibreChat host and MCP client
    participant Model as Local provider adapter - Ollama first
    participant MCP as Comparison tool facade
    participant DB as Knowledge PostgreSQL and AGE
    participant Worker as Local ingest worker
    participant Git as Complete local Git cache

    User->>Host: Compare selected old/new component at migration step
    Host->>Model: Question with permitted comparison tools
    Model-->>Host: Proposed compare call with explicit selectors
    Host->>MCP: compare(projectId, stepId, old, new, scope)
    MCP->>DB: Validate step members and resolve both analysis snapshots
    alt Manifest invalid or local source/history missing
        MCP-->>Host: Incomplete or failed; exact missing inputs and evidence gaps
        Host-->>User: Explain blocker without inventing changes or history
    else Both source selections are available
        alt Either analysis snapshot is not published
            MCP->>DB: Enqueue idempotent jobs for missing analyses
            MCP-->>Host: Queued with pinned selections and job IDs
            Worker->>DB: Claim job with lease
            Worker->>Git: Read exact commit locally; no fetch or repository execution
            Worker->>Worker: Extract, normalize and validate canonical facts
            alt Extraction succeeds
                Worker->>DB: Stage then atomically publish snapshot
            else Extraction fails or coverage insufficient
                Worker->>DB: Record failure or partial coverage, not a complete snapshot
            end
            Host->>MCP: job_status(jobId) on explicit refresh
            MCP-->>Host: Ready or failed with coverage and snapshotId
            Note over Host,MCP: Retry the same pinned comparison only after required analyses are ready
        end
        opt Both selected analyses are ready
            MCP->>DB: Read old/new facts and accepted mapping evidence
            MCP->>Git: Diff selected code and test repository identity and ancestry
            alt Same repository and ancestor range
                Git-->>MCP: Endpoint diff plus commits in selected range
            else Same repository but divergent history
                Git-->>MCP: Endpoint diff, divergence and explicit history policy
            else Distinct repositories
                Git-->>MCP: Separate code/history tracks; no shared commit range
            end
            MCP->>MCP: Build deterministic ComparisonResult and evidence table
            MCP-->>Host: comparisonId, selectors, lineageMode, changes, evidence, coverage
            Host->>Model: Evidence-backed facts and explicit limitations
            Model-->>Host: Explanation citing evidence IDs; no completion claim
            Host-->>User: Original old/new diff and evidence table plus explanation
        end
    end
